# OTB Node Directory
# Deny by default. Explicitly allow reviewed files.

*

# Repository documentation
!.gitignore
!README.md
!SECURITY.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!.gitattributes

# Documentation directory
!docs/
!docs/*.md

# Source directories and individual files will be
# allowlisted after the project inventory is reviewed.

# Never track live credentials or registration data.
private/
admin-private/
admin-preview-private/
**/tokens.json
**/invitations.json
**/accounts.json
**/collector-status.json
**/enroll-transaction.json
**/uninstall-receipts.json

# Never track runtime data or recovery materials.
admin-live-test/
otb-bytecode-recovery/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
*.jsonl
*.bak
*.backup
*.pre-*
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.zip

# Local configuration
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.sqlite
*.db

